  Needs: needs-fixture: Parent StoryRun waiting >= 144h processed by T-1d2 reminder producer / T-NTF1 reminder sweep (python -m sketch2life.infrastructure.notifications.notification_worker reminders --once)
  Expected: 200 / NotificationPageV1 containing RUN_WAIT_REMINDER v1 with empty safe_parameters and no run/recipient identifiers
